{"type":"text","id":"instruction_t","x":85,"y":185,"width":580,"height":255,"text":"INSTRUCTION LAYER — make selection and scope inspectable\n\n01  check_routers.py → duplicated policy and drift (semantic comparison absent)\n02  levels.py + detect_breaking.py → loaded-vs-executed context cost (no runtime)\n03  trigger-cases.json → reciprocal exclusions route neighbours (no referential check)\n04  resolve_globs.py → dead glob + missing index row (no overlap check)\n05  audit.py → imported-rule truth percentage (only cited paths checked)\n06  low-freedom.py → rollback refuses protected or unsafe state (levels not marked)\n07  choose.py → skill / command / subagent trade-off (declarations, no runtime)","originalText":"INSTRUCTION LAYER — make selection and scope inspectable\n\n01  check_routers.py → duplicated policy and drift (semantic comparison absent)\n02  levels.py + detect_breaking.py → loaded-vs-executed context cost (no runtime)\n03  trigger-cases.json → reciprocal exclusions route neighbours (no referential check)\n04  resolve_globs.py → dead glob + missing index row (no overlap check)\n05  audit.py → imported-rule truth percentage (only cited paths checked)\n06  low-freedom.py → rollback refuses protected or unsafe state (levels not marked)\n07  choose.py → skill / command / subagent trade-off (declarations, no runtime)","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":4,"version":1,"versionNonce":4,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"instruction","lineHeight":1.25},
{"type":"rectangle","id":"build","x":745,"y":160,"width":640,"height":310,"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","backgroundColor":"#ddd6fe","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":5,"version":1,"versionNonce":5,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
{"type":"text","id":"build_t","x":775,"y":185,"width":580,"height":255,"text":"BUILD + VALIDATION — turn judgment into a falsifiable gate\n\n08  validate_brief.py → same brief passes moderate, fails complex (tier is supplied)\n09  scaffold.py → validate.py → package.py → package refuses malformed input\n10  harness.py → positive / negative / ambiguous routing regression (mock router)\n11  validate_evaluation.py → detects inflated evaluation against frozen contract\n12  session_start.py + session_end.py → bounded, fail-open memory capture\n13  flush.py + compile.py → hash-driven compilation no-op / pending source\n\nThe argument: a non-zero exit becomes enforcement only when a later stage consumes it.","originalText":"BUILD + VALIDATION — turn judgment into a falsifiable gate\n\n08  validate_brief.py → same brief passes moderate, fails complex (tier is supplied)\n09  scaffold.py → validate.py → package.py → package refuses malformed input\n10  harness.py → positive / negative / ambiguous routing regression (mock router)\n11  validate_evaluation.py → detects inflated evaluation against frozen contract\n12  session_start.py + session_end.py → bounded, fail-open memory capture\n13  flush.py + compile.py → hash-driven compilation no-op / pending source\n\nThe argument: a non-zero exit becomes enforcement only when a later stage consumes it.","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":6,"version":1,"versionNonce":6,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"build","lineHeight":1.25},
{"type":"rectangle","id":"memory","x":55,"y":535,"width":640,"height":285,"strokeColor":"#047857","backgroundColor":"#a7f3d0","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":7,"version":1,"versionNonce":7,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
{"type":"text","id":"memory_t","x":85,"y":560,"width":580,"height":230,"text":"MEMORY + SAFETY — make durable knowledge inspectable before trusting it\n\n14  query.py → selected documents and reasons; exact vocabulary miss is honest\n15  lint.py → four planted corpus defects; empty categories are a warning signal\n16  ladder.py → deny-first command policy; shell wrapper bypass remains visible\n17  gate.py → ambiguous target resolves STRICT; typed confirmation for critical work\n18  redact.py + restricted_paths.py → values removed, keys + audit survive; DSN misses\n\nThe argument: safety is a boundary with a report, not a reassurance in prose.","originalText":"MEMORY + SAFETY — make durable knowledge inspectable before trusting it\n\n14  query.py → selected documents and reasons; exact vocabulary miss is honest\n15  lint.py → four planted corpus defects; empty categories are a warning signal\n16  ladder.py → deny-first command policy; shell wrapper bypass remains visible\n17  gate.py → ambiguous target resolves STRICT; typed confirmation for critical work\n18  redact.py + restricted_paths.py → values removed, keys + audit survive; DSN misses\n\nThe argument: safety is a boundary with a report, not a reassurance in prose.","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":8,"version":1,"versionNonce":8,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"memory","lineHeight":1.25},
{"type":"rectangle","id":"delivery","x":745,"y":535,"width":640,"height":285,"strokeColor":"#b45309","backgroundColor":"#fef3c7","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":9,"version":1,"versionNonce":9,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
{"type":"text","id":"delivery_t","x":775,"y":560,"width":580,"height":230,"text":"DELIVERY + REGENERATION — make the next action and its evidence explicit\n\n19  detect.py + check_handoff.py → blocked prerequisite and actionable next step\n20  map.py + drift.py → cited repository pack becomes stale after topology change\n\nCOMPOUND WALKTHROUGH\npipelines/session-memory-loop/walkthrough.sh runs 12 → 13 → 14 → 15,\nthen cleans up every created artifact with a shell trap.\n\nThe argument: a handoff, a map, and a pipeline are useful only while their claims\ncan still be re-run against the world they describe.","originalText":"DELIVERY + REGENERATION — make the next action and its evidence explicit\n\n19  detect.py + check_handoff.py → blocked prerequisite and actionable next step\n20  map.py + drift.py → cited repository pack becomes stale after topology change\n\nCOMPOUND WALKTHROUGH\npipelines/session-memory-loop/walkthrough.sh runs 12 → 13 → 14 → 15,\nthen cleans up every created artifact with a shell trap.\n\nThe argument: a handoff, a map, and a pipeline are useful only while their claims\ncan still be re-run against the world they describe.","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":10,"version":1,"versionNonce":10,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"delivery","lineHeight":1.25}],"appState":{"viewBackgroundColor":"#ffffff","gridSize":20},"files":{}}
